Claude Subscription DirectSDK
=============================

lunR's Claude Code subscription transport (packages/ai/src/api/anthropic-claude-code-bridge.ts,
claude-code-loopback.ts, and the setup probes in packages/ai/src/auth/oauth/anthropic.ts) is a TypeScript
port of logic from https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-plugin-claude-subscription-directsdk at
f1c1220778c7864fe4c1494baf9b1566e7c95bd2. The original license follows.

